<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Renault raised at JP Morgan.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Renault raised at JP Morgan.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>French carmaker Renault was raised to &quot;buy&quot; at JP Morgan, the investment bank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Setting a 12-month price target of between 185 and 195 francs, analyst Camilla Darwin said there were signs that the core automotive business was recovering from last year's losses.</p>
<p>Strength of sterling should give a substantial boost to Renault's results, the analyst said.</p>
<p>Renault shares were up 2.6 percent at 159.5 francs.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
